\alias{pofinite}
\docType{package}
\title{Finite-Iteration Pseudo-Observation Prediction}
\description{
A fixed, deterministic three-start matrix predictor for raw risk
pseudo-observations with a complementary log-log conditional mean, unit
Gaussian working variance, unit row weights and working independence.
}
\details{
This is an experimental package by Yumei Yang, distributed under the MIT license.

The package provides finite prediction endpoints and optimization diagnostics.
It is not a general GEE replacement and does not provide robust standard errors
or coefficient inference. All included examples and tests use synthetic inputs.
See \code{\link{pofinite_fit}} for scope and numerical restrictions.
}
\keyword{package}
